#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:602
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions for multi-node deployment:"
msgstr "多节点部署的关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:604
msgid ""
"In addition to all single-node parameters described in [Single-Node Online "
"Deployment](#51-single-node-online-deployment), the following parameters are"
" specific to multi-node deployment:"
msgstr ""
"除了[单节点在线部署](#51-single-node-online-deployment)中描述的所有单节点参数外，以下参数是多节点部署特有的："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:606
msgid "**Network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**网络和数据并行配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:608
msgid ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node "
"communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via "
"`ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be "
"correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication."
msgstr ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：多节点通信的网络接口配置。将"
" `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP "
"地址。这些必须在每个节点上正确配置，多节点通信才能成功。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:609
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all "
"nodes. For 2-node deployment, typically set to `2`."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size`：所有节点上的数据并行 rank 总数。对于 2 节点部署，通常设置为 `2`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:610
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current "
"node. Usually set to `1` (one DP rank per node)."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local`：当前节点上的数据并行 rank 数量。通常设置为 `1`（每个节点一个 DP rank）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:611
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node"
" 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:612
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port`: RPC port for data parallel master communication."
" Must be the same across all nodes."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:613
msgid ""
"`--headless`: Indicates this is a non-master node. Do not use on node 0."
msgstr "`--headless`：表示这是非主节点。不要在节点 0 上使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:614
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks "
"on this node. Node 0 uses `0`; node 1 uses the number of DP ranks on node 0 "
"(e.g., `1` for DP2, `4` for DP8)."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-"
"rank`：当前节点上数据并行秩的起始偏移量。节点0使用`0`；节点1使用节点0上的DP秩数量（例如，DP2为`1`，DP8为`4`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:616
msgid "**Multi-node performance tuning:**"
msgstr "**多节点性能调优：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:618
msgid ""
"For low-latency multi-node scenarios, keep `--data-parallel-size-local 1` to"
" minimize cross-node communication."
msgstr "对于低延迟多节点场景，保持 `--data-parallel-size-local 1` 以最小化跨节点通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:619
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` should be tuned based on available KV cache memory after "
"model loading. For the w8a8c8 198K high-throughput scenario on A3, `6` is "
"recommended; for the 198K low-latency scenario, `16` is recommended. For "
"w4a8 on A2 multi-node with long context, start with `2` and increase if "
"memory permits."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs`应根据模型加载后可用的KV缓存内存进行调整。对于A3上w8a8c8 "
"198K高吞吐场景，建议设为`6`；对于198K低延迟场景，建议设为`16`。对于A2多节点长上下文场景下的w4a8，建议从`2`开始，若内存允许可适当增大。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:620
msgid ""
"All nodes in a multi-node deployment must use identical `--tensor-parallel-"
"size`, `--enable-expert-parallel`, and model weight path configurations."
msgstr ""
"多节点部署中的所有节点必须使用相同的 `--tensor-parallel-size`、`--enable-expert-parallel` "
"和模型权重路径配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:622
msgid "**w8a8c8-specific `--additional-config` fields:**"
msgstr "**w8a8c8特有的`--additional-config`字段：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:624
msgid ""
"`\"enable_dsa_cp\": true`: Enables DSA context parallelism to accelerate "
"long-context prefill."
msgstr "`\"enable_dsa_cp\": true`：启用DSA上下文并行以加速长上下文预填充。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:625
msgid ""
"`\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true` / `\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true`: Sparse "
"attention optimizations of the C8 quantized model."
msgstr ""
"`\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true` / `\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": "
"true`：C8量化模型的稀疏注意力优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:626
msgid ""
"`\"enable_balance_scheduling\": true`: Improves output throughput and "
"reduces TPOT in the v1 scheduler. Not recommended when Prefill-Decode is "
"separated."
msgstr ""
"`\"enable_balance_scheduling\": true`：在v1调度器中提高输出吞吐量并降低TPOT。当预填充-解码分离时不建议使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:627
msgid "`\"fuse_muls_add\": true`: Fuses multiply-add operations."
msgstr "`\"fuse_muls_add\": true`：融合乘加运算。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:628
msgid ""
"`\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true`: Overlaps shared-expert "
"computation on an additional stream. Automatically disabled when "
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`."
msgstr ""
"`\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": "
"true`：在额外流上重叠共享专家计算。当`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`时自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:632
msgid "5.3 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
msgstr "5.3 预填充-解码分离"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:634
msgid ""
"We'd like to show the deployment guide of `GLM-5` on multi-node environment "
"with Prefill-Decode (PD) disaggregation for better performance. *Prefill-"
"Decode Disaggregation* refers to the separation of the prefill stage and the"
" decode stage across different nodes to improve throughput and latency."
msgstr ""
"我们将展示`GLM-5`在多节点环境中采用预填充-解码（PD）分离部署的指南，以获得更佳性能。*预填充-"
"解码分离*是指将预填充阶段和解码阶段分布在不同节点上，以提高吞吐量并降低延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:636
msgid ""
"In the PD disaggregation scenario, Mooncake is used as the KV cache transfer"
" connector between the prefill and decode nodes. Please refer to [KV Cache "
"Pool (Ascend Store) Deployment Guide](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md) for the "
"Mooncake configuration."
msgstr ""
"在 PD 分离场景中，Mooncake 用作 prefill 节点和 decode 节点之间的 KV 缓存传输连接器。有关 Mooncake "
"的配置，请参考 [KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）部署指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)。"

