msgid "5.3.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A3 series)"
msgstr "5.3.2 预填充-解码分离（A3系列）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1056
msgid ""
"The high-throughput (198K context) scenario is validated on 4 Atlas 800 A3 "
"(128GB × 8): 2 prefill nodes (`PP2 TP16`, 78 layers partitioned as `41/37`, "
"one PP rank per node) and 2 decode nodes (`DP8 TP4`, 4 DP ranks per node). "
"The same scripts serve both the high-throughput and low-latency cases."
msgstr ""
"高吞吐（198K 上下文）场景已在 4 台 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）上验证：2 个 prefill 节点（`PP2 "
"TP16`，78 层按 `41/37` 划分，每个节点一个 PP rank）和 2 个 decode 节点（`DP8 TP4`，每个节点 4 个 DP "
"rank）。相同的脚本同时适用于高吞吐和低延迟场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1138
msgid ""
"The prefill script selects the node via `node_rank`: set `node_rank=0` on "
"prefill node 0 (PP master node, engine port `9081`) and `node_rank=1` on "
"prefill node 1 (non-master node, `--headless`, no API server)."
msgstr ""
"prefill 脚本通过 `node_rank` 选择节点：在 prefill 节点 0（PP 主节点，引擎端口 `9081`）上设置 "
"`node_rank=0`，在 prefill 节点 1（非主节点，`--headless`，无 API 服务器）上设置 `node_rank=1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1284
msgid "Decode node 0 (ranks 0–3)"
msgstr "Decode 节点 0（rank 0–3）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1286
msgid ""
"Launch one instance per DP rank via positional parameters: `$1` = visible "
"devices, `$2` = engine port, `$3` = data-parallel-size, `$4` = data-"
"parallel-rank, `$5` = data-parallel-address, `$6` = data-parallel-rpc-port, "
"`$7` = tensor-parallel-size. Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on decode node 0 "
"with the content below."
msgstr ""
"通过位置参数为每个 DP rank 启动一个实例：`$1` = 可见设备，`$2` = 引擎端口，`$3` = 数据并行大小，`$4` = 数据并行 "
"rank，`$5` = 数据并行地址，`$6` = 数据并行 RPC 端口，`$7` = 张量并行大小。在 decode 节点 0 上准备 "
"`run_dp_template.sh`，内容如下。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1360
msgid "Decode node 1 (ranks 4–7)"
msgstr "Decode 节点 1（rank 4–7）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1362
msgid "Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on decode node 1 with the content below."
msgstr "在 decode 节点 1 上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`，内容如下。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1466
msgid ""
"When testing with a prefix cache hit rate > 0, add `--enable-prefix-caching`"
" on the prefill nodes (as in the scripts above); when the hit rate is 0, use"
" `--no-enable-prefix-caching` instead."
msgstr ""
"当测试前缀缓存命中率大于0时，请在预填充节点上添加`--enable-prefix-"
"caching`（如上述脚本所示）；当命中率为0时，请改用`--no-enable-prefix-caching`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1467
msgid ""
"`\"recompute_scheduler_enable\"` is set to `false` on prefill nodes and "
"`true` on decode nodes in this scenario."
msgstr "在此场景中，`\"recompute_scheduler_enable\"`在预填充节点上设置为`false`，在解码节点上设置为`true`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1469
msgid "5.3.3 Request Forwarding and Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "5.3.3 请求转发及关键参数说明"

