msgid ""
"To set up request forwarding, run the following script on any machine. You "
"can get the proxy program in the repository's examples: "
"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"
msgstr ""
"要设置请求转发，请在任意机器上运行以下脚本。您可以在仓库的示例中获取代理程序：[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1473
msgid "**Ascend950DT series:**"
msgstr "**Ascend950DT系列：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1510
msgid "**A3 series:**"
msgstr "**A3系列：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1537
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions for PD separation deployment:"
msgstr "PD 分离部署的关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1539
msgid ""
"In addition to the single-node and multi-node parameters described above, "
"the following parameters are specific to Prefill-Decode disaggregation:"
msgstr "除了上述单节点和多节点参数外，以下参数是预填充-解码分离特有的："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1541
msgid "**Mooncake KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**Mooncake KV 传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1543
msgid ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache "
"transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 节点和 "
"decode 节点之间的 KV 缓存传输连接器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1544
msgid ""
"`\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"`: Set on prefill nodes — produces KV cache and"
" sends it to decode nodes. Use `\"kv_consumer\"` on decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"`：在 prefill 节点上设置——生成 KV 缓存并将其发送到 decode 节点。在 "
"decode 节点上使用 `\"kv_consumer\"`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1545
msgid ""
"`\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer communication. Each node group "
"should use a distinct port range."
msgstr "`\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV 传输通信的端口。每个节点组应使用不同的端口范围。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1546
msgid ""
"`\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct (RDMA-like) transfer "
"for KV cache, reducing latency."
msgstr "`\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为 KV 缓存启用 Ascend 直连（类似 RDMA）传输，降低延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1547
msgid ""
"`\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: Specify the `dp_size` and `tp_size` "
"of the prefill and decode node groups respectively. These must match the "
"actual deployment topology."
msgstr ""
"`\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` 部分：分别指定 prefill 和 decode 节点组的 `dp_size` 和 "
"`tp_size`。这些必须与实际部署拓扑匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1549
msgid "**Prefill node-specific configurations:**"
msgstr "**Prefill 节点专属配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1551
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables fused MC2 operators "
"(`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`) to optimize MoE communication. "
"Constraints: `dispatch_ffn_combine` only for w8a8 and EP≤32; `mega_moe` "
"works for w8a8/w4a8/bf16 with EP≤64. Both are incompatible with MTP and "
"dynamic EPLB."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用融合 MC2 "
"算子（`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`）以优化 MoE 通信。约束条件：`dispatch_ffn_combine` "
"仅适用于 w8a8 且 EP≤32；`mega_moe` 适用于 w8a8/w4a8/bf16 且 EP≤64。两者均与 MTP 和动态 EPLB "
"不兼容。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1552
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`: Enables DSA context "
"parallelism on prefill nodes to accelerate long-context prefill. Required "
"for handling prompts up to 128K tokens."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`：在 prefill 节点上启用 DSA "
"上下文并行，以加速长上下文 prefill。处理高达 128K token 的提示词时需要此配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1554
msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations:**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点专属配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1556
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: Enables MLA preprocess operation fusion on "
"decode nodes to significantly improve decode performance. Consumes more NPU "
"memory. In PD scenarios, enable MLAPO only on decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在 decode 节点上启用 MLA 预处理算子融合，显著提升 decode 性能。会消耗更多"
" NPU 内存。在 PD 场景中，仅在 decode 节点上启用 MLAPO。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1557
msgid ""
"On decode nodes, keep `--max-num-batched-tokens` close to `--max-num-seqs` —"
" decode processes one token per sequence per step (`164` in the A3 scenario,"
" `240` in the Ascend950DT scenario, see the scripts above)."
msgstr ""
"在解码节点上，保持`--max-num-batched-tokens`接近`--max-num-"
"seqs`——解码每步每个序列处理一个token（A3场景中为`164`，Ascend950DT场景中为`240`，参见上述脚本）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1558
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`: Enables the "
"recomputation scheduler. When decode node KV cache is insufficient, requests"
" are sent back to prefill nodes for KV cache recomputation. In this "
"deployment: `true` on decode nodes; on prefill nodes `true` in the "
"Ascend950DT scenario and `false` in the A3 scenario (see the scripts above)."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": "
"true}'`：启用重计算调度器。当解码节点KV缓存不足时，请求将被发送回预填充节点进行KV缓存重计算。在此部署中：解码节点上为`true`；预填充节点上在Ascend950DT场景中为`true`，在A3场景中为`false`（参见上述脚本）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1560
msgid "**Common PD environment variables:**"
msgstr "**PD 通用环境变量：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1562
msgid ""
"`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1`, `ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`: A3-specific optimizations"
" for communication aggregation."
msgstr "`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1`、`ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`：针对通信聚合的 A3 专属优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1563
msgid "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode."
msgstr "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1564
msgid ""
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=480`: Timeout (in seconds) for "
"automatically releasing the prefill node's KV cache when a request is "
"aborted."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=480`：请求中止时自动释放 prefill 节点 KV "
"缓存的超时时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1565
msgid ""
"`LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:/usr/local/lib`: Required for Mooncake "
"library loading."
msgstr "`LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:/usr/local/lib`：Mooncake 库加载所需。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1567
msgid "**MTP in PD scenarios:**"
msgstr "**PD 场景中的 MTP：**"

