#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1614
msgid "9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "9 性能调优"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1616
msgid "9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "9.1推荐配置"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1618
msgid ""
"**Note**: The following configurations are validated in specific test "
"environments and are for reference only. The optimal configuration depends "
"on factors such as maximum input/output length, prefix cache hit rate, "
"precision requirements, and deployment machine ratios. It is recommended to "
"refer to [Tuning Guidelines](#92-tuning-guidelines) for tuning based on "
"actual conditions."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：以下配置已在特定测试环境中验证，仅供参考。最佳配置取决于最大输入/输出长度、前缀缓存命中率、精度要求和部署机器比例等因素。建议根据实际情况参考[调优指南](#92-tuning-"
"guidelines)进行调优。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1620
msgid ""
"The tables below provide recommended parameter configurations for the "
"`GLM-5.1-w8a8c8` quantized model on Atlas 800 A3, covering three deployment "
"scenarios:"
msgstr "下表提供了`GLM-5.1-w8a8c8`量化模型在Atlas 800 A3上的推荐参数配置，涵盖三种部署场景："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1622
msgid ""
"**Dual-Node Co-Located 198K High Throughput**: `DP8 TP4`, see [Multi-node "
"Deployment](#52-multi-node-deployment)."
msgstr "**双节点共置198K高吞吐**：`DP8 TP4`，参见[多节点部署](#52-multi-node-deployment)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1623
msgid ""
"**Dual-Node Co-Located 198K Low Latency**: `DP2 TP16`, see [Multi-node "
"Deployment](#52-multi-node-deployment)."
msgstr "**双节点共置198K低延迟**：`DP2 TP16`，参见[多节点部署](#52-multi-node-deployment)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1624
msgid ""
"**Prefill-Decode Disaggregation 198K (PP2)**: prefill `PP2 TP16` + decode "
"`DP8 TP4`, see [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A3 series)](#532-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation-a3-series)."
msgstr ""
"**预填充-解码分离 198K (PP2)**：预填充 `PP2 TP16` + 解码 `DP8 TP4`，参见[预填充-"
"解码分离（A3系列）](#532-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3-series)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1625
msgid ""
"**Prefill-Decode Disaggregation 198K (Ascend950DT)**: prefill `TP8` (DSA CP "
"8) + decode `DP16 TP1`, see [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (Ascend950DT "
"series)](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation-ascend950dt-series)."
msgstr ""
"**预填充-解码分离 198K (Ascend950DT)**：预填充 `TP8`（DSA CP 8）+ 解码 `DP16 TP1`，参见[预填充-"
"解码分离（Ascend950DT系列）](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation-ascend950dt-series)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1627
msgid ""
"Test cases use the notation `input/output`, e.g., `128k/1k` means 128K input"
" tokens and 1K output tokens; `@50%/90%` marks the prefix cache hit rate. "
"When the prefix cache hit rate is > 0, add `--enable-prefix-caching`; when "
"the hit rate is 0, add `--no-enable-prefix-caching` instead (for the PD "
"scenario, this applies to the prefill nodes)."
msgstr ""
"测试用例使用 `输入/输出` 表示法，例如 `128k/1k` 表示128K输入token和1K输出token；`@50%/90%` "
"标记前缀缓存命中率。当前缀缓存命中率 > 0 时，添加 `--enable-prefix-caching`；当命中率为 0 时，改为添加 `--no-"
"enable-prefix-caching`（对于PD场景，此设置适用于预填充节点）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1629
msgid "9.1.1 Table 1: Detailed Node Configuration"
msgstr "9.1.1 表1：详细节点配置"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1631
msgid ""
"The TP/DP columns show the values **per node** as configured in the "
"Deployment scripts (a co-located node hosting 4 DP ranks of TP4 uses 16 "
"NPUs; a PD prefill node hosting 1 DP rank of TP16 uses 16 NPUs; a PD decode "
"node hosting 4 DP ranks of TP4 uses 16 NPUs; an Ascend950DT node hosting 8 "
"cards). The 198K PD scenario prefill side uses `PP2 TP16` with the layer "
"partition `41,37`. All A3 scenarios use the `GLM-5.1-w8a8c8` weights; the "
"Ascend950DT scenarios use the `GLM-5.1-w4a4` weights."
msgstr ""
"TP/DP列显示部署脚本中配置的**每节点**值（一个共置节点承载4个TP4的DP rank，使用16个NPU；一个PD预填充节点承载1个TP16的DP"
" rank，使用16个NPU；一个PD解码节点承载4个TP4的DP rank，使用16个NPU；一个Ascend950DT节点承载8张卡）。198K "
"PD场景的预填充侧使用 `PP2 TP16`，层分区为 `41,37`。所有A3场景使用 `GLM-5.1-w8a8c8` "
"权重；Ascend950DT场景使用 `GLM-5.1-w4a4` 权重。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1633
msgid ""
"When testing with a prefix cache hit rate > 0, keep `--enable-prefix-"
"caching` (as in the deployment scripts); when the hit rate is 0, replace it "
"with `--no-enable-prefix-caching`."
msgstr ""
"当前缀缓存命中率 > 0 时，保留 `--enable-prefix-caching`（与部署脚本一致）；当命中率为 0 时，将其替换为 `--no-"
"enable-prefix-caching`。"

